==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|до-|ходи́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|доходи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-доходить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|доходи́ть|impf|pf=дойти́}}

# to [[come]] to, to [[arrive]] at, to [[reach]] (''usually by foot'')
#: {{uxi|ru|[[письмо|Письмо́]] [[до]] [[он|него́]] [[не]] [[дойти|дошло́]]|t=the letter did not reach him.}}
# {{lb|ru|by|_|extension}} to finally or eventually [[get]] to, to [[achieve]] some state or condition
#: {{uxi|ru|[[раньше|Ра́ньше]] [[у]] [[они|них]] [[про́сто]] [[руки не доходят|ру́ки не '''доходи́ли''']] [[до]] [[этот|э́того]]|t=They just had too many things on their plate before.}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal|colloquial}} to become [[understood]] (by someone) (e.g. about a [[joke]] or [[fraud]])
#: {{uxi|ru|До [[тебя]] [[всё ещё]] не '''дошло́'''?|Do you still not '''get it'''?}}
# to come down to
# ''(prices)'' to [[rise]], to run up to, to [[amount]] to
#: {{uxi|ru|[[расход|Расхо́ды]] '''дохо́дят''' до 10.000 [[рубль|рубле́й]]|the expenses total 10,000 rubles.}}
# {{lb|ru|vulgar}} to [[ejaculate]], to [[cum]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|4c|доходи́ть}}

